   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "## QuantFunc Qwen-Image-2.1\n\n- **QuantFunc Qwen-Image-2.1 Loader** replaces the official `Load Diffusion Model` (UNETLoader): the QuantFunc engine runs the 32-block transformer; the text encoder (`CLIPLoader`, type `qwen_image`), `TextEncodeQwenImage21`, the VAE, the sampler and CFG stay stock ComfyUI.\n- `transformer`: the QuantFunc int4 export under `models/diffusion_models`.\n- `quality_enhance`: OFF (default) is faster; the subject and scene stay the same, but details such as poses, faces or small objects can differ. ON gives the highest quality.\n- Output is **RGBA**: `VAE Decode` + `Save Image` keep the alpha channel, so a transparent result saves as a transparent PNG.\n- Default settings: 6 steps, CFG 1, res_multistep / simple with QuantFunc Native LoRA (`qwen_image_21_lightning_v2_rl_4steps_lora_rank64.safetensors`, strength 1.0).\n\n**Remove the background -> transparent PNG** (the official Qwen-Image-2.1 prompt). The subject stays opaque, the background alpha goes to 0; `Save Image` keeps it."
   ]
  },
